  <section>
    <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
    <p>Maine Dispensary Guide is an editorial resource for people building and operating licensed cannabis businesses in Maine. The Site currently publishes 109 city and town guides covering municipal licensing, zoning, and operating realities across the state; a library of technical guides for cultivators, manufacturers, retailers, and testing laboratories; a free ROI calculator that models revenue, cost of goods, and capital requirements under current Maine tax and regulatory structure; and lead-capture forms that connect readers with vetted attorneys, CPAs, architects, and service providers.</p>
    <p>The Site is free to read. Some content and tools generate revenue through affiliate links (see Section 9) and through clearly labeled sponsored placements. We do not sell Maine cannabis directly, do not hold a cannabis license of any kind, and are not a participant in the cannabis supply chain. We are an information publisher serving the people who operate Maine-licensed cannabis businesses.</p>
  </section>

