      <li>Republish, redistribute, or syndicate any content from the Site, in whole or in part, on another site, in a newsletter, in a print publication, or in any artificial intelligence training dataset, except as permitted under Section 4.</li>
      <li>Access cannabis-related content on the Site if you are under 21 years of age. Maine law restricts access to cannabis business information as well as to cannabis products, and the licensing pathways we cover are adult professions.</li>
      <li>Attempt to probe, scan, or test the vulnerability of the Site, breach authentication, or interfere with its operation, including by introducing viruses, malware, or excessive load.</li>
