  <section>
    <h2>5. Disclaimers — Not Professional Advice</h2>
    <p>The content on this Site is published for general informational purposes only. It is not legal advice, financial advice, tax advice, medical advice, or a substitute for consultation with a licensed professional. No attorney-client, advisor-client, or fiduciary relationship is created by your use of the Site, the submission of a lead-capture form, or any communication with us. Always consult a Maine-licensed attorney, CPA, or other qualified professional before acting on information that affects your business, taxes, license, or compliance posture.</p>
    <p>Specifically with respect to operator and licensing data: the names, addresses, license types, and license numbers for Maine cannabis operators that appear in our city guides and operator profiles are compiled from publicly available filings with the Maine Office of Cannabis Policy (OCP) and municipal authorities. We make reasonable efforts to verify these records, but licensing status changes frequently. Before you rely on any operator record for a transaction, lease, supply contract, investment, or due diligence, verify the current status against the OCP's public records and the relevant municipal license file.</p>
    <p>If you find an error in any data we have published, please report it. Our public corrections log at <a href="/about/corrections">/about/corrections</a> is the audit trail of every material correction we have made, with the date, the prior value, the corrected value, and the source. That log is the definitive record of fact changes on this Site.</p>
